OL,3,GNEWSAScottish man jailed for
OL,4,Aracially-motivated offences during
OL,5,ABelfast riots
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 25-year-old Scottish man has been
OL,8,Fjailed for racially-motivated "violent
OL,9,Fdisorder" linked to rioting in Belfast
OL,10,Fduring the summer of 2024.
OL,12,FReece Dunnett, from Dunfermline in
OL,13,FFife, pleaded guilty to rioting and
OL,14,Fcriminal damage offences at Laganside
OL,15,FCrown Court on Friday.
OL,17,FHe received a 27-month sentence - half
OL,18,Fof which to be spent in prison and half
OL,19,Fon licence after his release.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
