OL,4,Aracially-motivated offences during
OL,5,ABelfast riots
OL,6,
OL,7,FDunnett committed the offences after
OL,8,Ftrouble arose in the Sandy Row and
OL,9,FDonegall Road areas of south Belfast on
OL,10,F3 August 2024.
